{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://puppetmaster.local/schemas/lsp-restart-selected/1.0.0/lsp_restart_selected_contracts.schema.json",
  "title": "Typed restart companion for exactly cmd.lsp.restart_server; static only, no native proof",
  "description": "LSPS-113 machine companion. Binds the immutable original selected server identity and the current LSP session generation, environment connection epoch, and topology generation through the current permission snapshot and owner request; preserves pre-write cancellation versus post-commit pending reconciliation; carries the owner-qualified terminal/deferred result, error, and redacted receipt. Each case also carries an owner_witness channel (complete original SIR dispatch with canonical payload digest, dispatch frame, independent SIR target generation, and full source IdentityEnvelope; live current; outcome refs; full SIR CommandOutcomeRecord) and the full central v2 response so joins compare the claim against an independent channel instead of against itself. SIR target generation is an independent domain, never equated with LSP session generation, connection epoch, topology generation, or operation generation. Static shape only: authenticates no issuer, grants no permission, proves no restart, and admits no handler, event, family, or retention.",
  "x-owner-ref": "Plans/LSPSupport.md#LSPS-113",
  "x-command-id": "cmd.lsp.restart_server",
